{{!
    @template format_aicourse/content

    The AI Course format course home page: the General section rendered inline, followed by the
    grid of section cards and, for a teacher with edit mode on, the "Add section" card and the
    icon picker modal.

    The container is a named landmark region and the grid carries list semantics, so a screen
    reader announces the number of sections. The list roles are dropped in edit mode because the
    "Add section" <button> is a grid child and a role="list" may only contain listitem children.

    Classes required for JS:
    * aicourse-cards-container - the element amd/src/local/cardcontent.js registers with the
      reactive course editor; it is also the element core's action dispatcher delegates from, so
      every data-action inside it (including the core action menus the General section renders in
      edit mode) reaches the matching core mutation.
    * acf-grid--sections - the reorderable section list.

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-for="course_sectionlist" - lets core_courseformat's reactive state manager find the
      section list so section move/visibility mutations can update the grid.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * regionlabel string Accessible name of the cards region (plain text).
    * courseid int Course ID.
    * isediting bool True when the teacher has edit mode turned on.
    * uselistroles bool True when role="list"/role="listitem" should be emitted (never in edit mode).
    * generalsection object|null Context for format_aicourse/general_section, or null when section 0
      is not visible to this user.
    * sections array List of contexts for format_aicourse/section_card.
    * iconpicker string|null PRE-ESCAPED HTML for the icon picker modal, produced by the
      \format_aicourse\output\courseformat\iconpicker renderable. Rendered with a triple mustache
      because it is already a rendered template; null when edit mode is off.
    * bulkedittools object|null Context for core_courseformat/local/content/bulkedittools, the
      sticky action bar Moodle's "Bulk actions" header button drives; null outside edit mode.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "regionlabel": "Course sections",
        "courseid": 2,
        "isediting": false,
        "uselistroles": true,
        "generalsection": {
            "hasoutput": true,
            "usecoresection": false,
            "headingclass": "aicourse-general-heading accesshide",
            "sectionname": "General",
            "hassummary": true,
            "summary": "<p>Welcome to the course.</p>",
            "activitycards": null
        },
        "sections": [
            {
                "sectionid": 35,
                "sectionnum": 1,
                "courseid": 2,
                "sectionurl": "https://example.org/course/section.php?id=35",
                "sectionname": "Module 1: Foundations",
                "isediting": false,
                "uselistroles": true,
                "showeditbuttons": false,
                "sectionbulk": null,
                "media": null,
                "cardstyle": "",
                "cardstate": "progress",
                "eyebrow": "Module 1",
                "hastime": true,
                "estimatedtime": "25 min",
                "cardlinklabel": "Module 1: Foundations, 3 activities, Estimated time 25 min, 33% complete",
                "hassummary": true,
                "summary": "What machine learning is and why it matters.",
                "hascount": true,
                "counttext": "3 activities",
                "hasprogress": true,
                "percentnum": 33,
                "donetext": "1 of 3 done",
                "statustext": "33% complete",
                "ctastate": "continue",
                "ctatext": "Continue",
                "hasactivities": false,
                "activities": [],
                "moreactivities": null
            }
        ],
        "iconpicker": null,
        "bulkedittools": null
    }
}}
<div class="acf-cards aicourse-cards-container" role="region" aria-label="{{regionlabel}}">
{{#generalsection}}
{{> format_aicourse/general_section }}
{{/generalsection}}
<h2 class="accesshide">{{regionlabel}}</h2>
{{#isediting}}
<div class="acf-toolbar">
<button type="button" class="acf-btn acf-btn--ai" data-action="aicourse-cardimage-all"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.94 14.06 8 20l-1.94-5.94L0 12l6.06-1.94L8 4l1.94 6.06L16 12z" transform="translate(2 0) scale(.9)"/><path d="M20 3v4"/><path d="M22 5h-4"/></svg>{{#str}} cardimage_all_button, format_aicourse {{/str}}</button>
</div>
{{/isediting}}
<div class="acf-grid acf-grid--sections"{{#uselistroles}} role="list"{{/uselistroles}} data-for="course_sectionlist">
{{#sections}}
{{> format_aicourse/section_card }}
{{/sections}}
{{#isediting}}
{{> format_aicourse/add_section_card }}
{{/isediting}}
</div>
{{{iconpicker}}}
{{#bulkedittools}}
{{$ core_courseformat/local/content/bulkedittools }}
{{> core_courseformat/local/content/bulkedittools }}
{{/ core_courseformat/local/content/bulkedittools }}
{{/bulkedittools}}
</div>
